>Scene Voices Included</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >H-scenes with voices. The lewdness is presented with their voices! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Animation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animations for erotic events during battles! Smooth, fluid animations enhance the sensuality. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Erotic Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some monsters will attack during battles! Clothing may be torn, restraint may occur, and if unable to escape, violation follows! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Erotic combat events are limited to Elaine.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Erotic Status</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fundamental erotic RPG element, the Erotic Status system, is fully integrated! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First experiences, current partner and situation, and the numerical value of erotic exp are recorded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Karma Value</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging in wrongful acts increases the &quot;Karma Value.&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When this value rises, consequences such as arrest or encountering lascivious situations may occur...?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lewdness Level</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Elaine experiences erotic situations, her lewdness level increases.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The reaction of Elaine in erotic scenes changes based on this value!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No Game Over</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if defeated in battle, the game does not end in a game over, allowing you to continue the game with peace of mind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >150,000 words of rich content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completely explain the story of the heroine and other characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766940/extras/57584f1c9b1